  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "l1",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "An exam is under way. Everyone is writing as best they can, some on their own, but most from cheat sheets.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l2",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "But anyone caught using one is thrown out without mercy: the examiner is a beast and knows his job. The rows slowly thin out.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.4,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l3",
      "character": "nachalnik",
      "text": "Hello, which group is this, what's the exam?",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l4",
      "character": "doktor",
      "text": "Group one hundred twelve, they're taking calculus.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l5",
      "character": "nachalnik",
      "text": "Amateur cheaters, I bet?",
      "emotion": "smug",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.7,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l6",
      "character": "doktor",
      "text": "Oh no, the amateurs have long been out in the corridor. Only the professionals are left in here!",
      "emotion": "smug",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.8,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": [],
      "laugh": "big"
    }
  ],
